DTSTAMP:20260812T114326Z
UID:477e8388dee88df60dc070123136@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This workshop reviews common neck and shoulder ailments (from 
 whiplash\, rotator cuff issues\, frozen shoulder\, tension headaches\, to 
 just that stiff neck you sometimes get). We explain why many of those issu
 es occur and provide exercises to help relieve the area\, but also strengt
 hen and tone it in a functional way. We talk about the rib-shoulder connec
 tion. It's possible you are doing the right exercises\, but never seen res
 ults\, that might be why. Materials needed: yoga mat & pillow\n\nSource: h
